# Allowlist: ignore everything, then add back only what is safe to publish.
# Never commit: the ElevenLabs key file, the EPUB, book photos (epub-images/, guard-photos/),
# the private build (drill-caller*.html), book notes, or audio archives.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/index.html
!/fiore-drawings/
!/build_public.py
!/elevenlabs.py
!/generate_voice.py
!/embed_voice.py
